{
  "title": "Privacy Policy",
  "intro": [
    {
      "t": "p",
      "c": [
        "How Flatrimony protects your personal information, verifies identity via DigiLocker, and handles data under India's Digital Personal Data Protection (DPDP) Act, 2023."
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "c": [
        "Last updated: [DD Month YYYY]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "c": [
        "Effective immediately for all registered users"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "sections": [
    {
      "title": "1. What We Collect",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "t": "p",
          "c": [
            "Flatrimony adheres to strict ",
            {
              "t": "strong",
              "c": [
                "data minimization principles"
              ]
            },
            ". We capture only the information required to calculate lifestyle compatibility matrices, eradicate rental broker infiltration, and uphold roommate personal safety during physical flat inspections across Delhi NCR."
          ]
        },
        {
          "t": "p",
          "c": [
            "What we never collect"
          ]
        },
        {
          "t": "ul",
          "c": [
            {
              "t": "li",
              "c": [
                {
                  "t": "strong",
                  "c": [
                    "No Contact List Scraping:"
                  ]
                },
                " We never request, read, or sync your phone address book or WhatsApp contacts."
              ]
            },
            " ",
            {
              "t": "li",
              "c": [
                {
                  "t": "strong",
                  "c": [
                    "No Persistent Geolocation Tracking:"
                  ]
                },
                " We do not track your real-time or background coordinates. Coordinates are collected solely on an explicit, one-time manual basis during an activated safety session session."
              ]
            },
            " ",
            {
              "t": "li",
              "c": [
                {
                  "t": "strong",
                  "c": [
                    "No Banking Credentials:"
                  ]
                },
                " We never capture, store, or process raw credit cards, debit PINs, net banking passwords, or UPI MPINs."
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "t": "p",
          "c": [
            "Data points we collect directly from you:"
          ]
        },
        {
          "t": "ul",
          "c": [
            {
              "t": "li",
              "c": [
                {
                  "t": "strong",
                  "c": [
                    "Profile & Tenancy Parameters:"
                  ]
                },
                " Sleep timings, AC temperature thresholds, dietary preferences (veg, non-veg, vegan, Jain), work schedules (hybrid, remote, on-site), and preferred Delhi Metro transit stations."
              ]
            },
            " ",
            {
              "t": "li",
              "c": [
                {
                  "t": "strong",
                  "c": [
                    "Authentication Credentials:"
                  ]
                },
                " Verified 10-digit mobile number and WhatsApp ID exclusively used for cryptographic One-Time Password (OTP) sign-ins."
              ]
            },
            " ",
            {
              "t": "li",
              "c": [
                {
                  "t": "strong",
                  "c": [
                    "Lifestyle Compatibility Questionnaires:"
                  ]
                },
                " Cleanliness standards, guest policies, pet tolerance, smoking/drinking preferences, and co-living social boundaries."
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "2. Identity Verification via DigiLocker",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "t": "p",
          "c": [
            "To maintain a zero-broker ecosystem and safeguard co-habitants from impersonators, Flatrimony connects to an authorized, Ministry of Electronics and Information Technology (",
            {
              "t": "strong",
              "c": [
                "MeitY"
              ]
            },
            ")-licensed DigiLocker partner gateway."
          ]
        },
        {
          "t": "p",
          "c": [
            "What Flatrimony Retains"
          ]
        },
        {
          "t": "ul",
          "c": [
            {
              "t": "li",
              "c": [
                "Legal First & Last Name"
              ]
            },
            " ",
            {
              "t": "li",
              "c": [
                "Date of Birth (Age confirmation)"
              ]
            },
            " ",
            {
              "t": "li",
              "c": [
                "Gender"
              ]
            },
            " ",
            {
              "t": "li",
              "c": [
                "Irreversible cryptographic verification token hash"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "t": "p",
          "c": [
            "What Flatrimony NEVER Stores"
          ]
        },
        {
          "t": "ul",
          "c": [
            {
              "t": "li",
              "c": [
                "National ID numbers or documents"
              ]
            },
            " ",
            {
              "t": "li",
              "c": [
                "Scanned or original identity PDF files"
              ]
            },
            " ",
            {
              "t": "li",
              "c": [
                "Biometric data (fingerprint or iris)"
              ]
            },
            " ",
            {
              "t": "li",
              "c": [
                "Raw PAN, voter ID, or passport numbers"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "t": "p",
          "c": [
            "We verify your identity through DigiLocker. We keep your name, date of birth, gender and a verification reference. We never ask for or store your ID number."
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "3. How We Use Your Data",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "t": "p",
          "c": [
            "Your personal data is processed solely for explicit platform functions that create balanced, friction-free housemate matches:"
          ]
        },
        {
          "t": "p",
          "c": [
            {
              "t": "strong",
              "c": [
                "Deterministic Matching Algorithms:"
              ]
            },
            " We compute cross-attribute compatibility scores (e.g., 94% lifestyle sync) by contrasting sleep curves, noise tolerance, kitchen hygiene benchmarks, and commute transit zones."
          ]
        },
        {
          "t": "p",
          "c": [
            {
              "t": "strong",
              "c": [
                "Automated Anti-Broker Heuristics:"
              ]
            },
            " Algorithmic pattern detection analyses bulk message frequency and repetitive listing copy to immediately flag and eject commercial estate agents."
          ]
        },
        {
          "t": "p",
          "c": [
            {
              "t": "strong",
              "c": [
                "Safety Incident Resolution & SOS Triggers:"
              ]
            },
            " In the event a user triggers the in-app emergency alert or files an harassment report, data audit logs are accessed by human trust officers to arbitrate disputes."
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "4. Where Your Data Lives (India Residency)",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "t": "p",
          "c": [
            "In strict compliance with local data localization mandates, all Flatrimony primary relational databases, user profiles, lifestyle biodatas, chat logs, and safety records are hosted exclusively within Indian territorial boundaries:"
          ]
        },
        {
          "t": "p",
          "c": [
            "Primary Indian Data Facilities: Your data is stored in India, in Mumbai: our database runs on Supabase (South Asia – Mumbai region) and our servers run on Google Cloud (Mumbai region)."
          ]
        },
        {
          "t": "p",
          "c": [
            {
              "t": "strong",
              "c": [
                "Cross-Border Telemetry Restrictions:"
              ]
            },
            " Minor pseudonymous diagnostic metrics (such as mobile app crash logs or network latency counters) may be processed with ISO-27001 certified global logging providers. These telemetry events are programmatically stripped of real names, phone numbers, GPS coordinates, and private conversation payloads prior to transmission."
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "5. Data Sharing & Disclosure",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "t": "p",
          "c": [
            "Flatrimony does not operate an open or indexable directory. Personal contact vectors are guarded behind progressive mutual consent barriers:"
          ]
        },
        {
          "t": "ul",
          "c": [
            {
              "t": "li",
              "c": [
                {
                  "t": "strong",
                  "c": [
                    "Two-Way Mutual Rishta Consent:"
                  ]
                },
                " Your contact number, complete biodata profile, and exact apartment unit number remain concealed from public view. They are revealed to another seeker solely after both users mutually accept a match request."
              ]
            },
            " ",
            {
              "t": "li",
              "c": [
                {
                  "t": "strong",
                  "c": [
                    "Designated Emergency Contacts:"
                  ]
                },
                " During active safety session visits or an SOS broadcast, temporary telemetry is transmitted exclusively to the emergency contact configured in your trust preferences."
              ]
            },
            " ",
            {
              "t": "li",
              "c": [
                {
                  "t": "strong",
                  "c": [
                    "Zero Commercial Data Monetization:"
                  ]
                },
                " We never sell, lease, barter, or distribute your identity or matching biodatas to real estate brokers, advertisers, financial lenders, or telemarketers."
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "6. Data Retention & Erasure Schedules",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "t": "p",
          "c": [
            "We do not hold digital residue longer than necessary for platform safety and legal compliance:"
          ]
        },
        {
          "t": "table",
          "c": [
            {
              "t": "thead",
              "c": [
                {
                  "t": "tr",
                  "c": [
                    {
                      "t": "th",
                      "c": [
                        "Data Classification"
                      ]
                    },
                    " ",
                    {
                      "t": "th",
                      "c": [
                        "Retention Window"
                      ]
                    },
                    " ",
                    {
                      "t": "th",
                      "c": [
                        "Purge Action"
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            " ",
            {
              "t": "tbody",
              "c": [
                {
                  "t": "tr",
                  "c": [
                    {
                      "t": "td",
                      "c": [
                        "Matched Chat Messages"
                      ]
                    },
                    " ",
                    {
                      "t": "td",
                      "c": [
                        "12 months from match close"
                      ]
                    },
                    " ",
                    {
                      "t": "td",
                      "c": [
                        "Permanently deleted from production databases"
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                " ",
                {
                  "t": "tr",
                  "c": [
                    {
                      "t": "td",
                      "c": [
                        "Unmatched Conversations"
                      ]
                    },
                    " ",
                    {
                      "t": "td",
                      "c": [
                        "90 calendar days of inactivity"
                      ]
                    },
                    " ",
                    {
                      "t": "td",
                      "c": [
                        "Automated cron garbage collection purge"
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                " ",
                {
                  "t": "tr",
                  "c": [
                    {
                      "t": "td",
                      "c": [
                        "safety session GPS Telemetry"
                      ]
                    },
                    " ",
                    {
                      "t": "td",
                      "c": [
                        "Session conclusion"
                      ]
                    },
                    " ",
                    {
                      "t": "td",
                      "c": [
                        "Instantly wiped upon exit confirmation"
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                " ",
                {
                  "t": "tr",
                  "c": [
                    {
                      "t": "td",
                      "c": [
                        "Account Erasure Request"
                      ]
                    },
                    " ",
                    {
                      "t": "td",
                      "c": [
                        "Within 30 calendar days"
                      ]
                    },
                    " ",
                    {
                      "t": "td",
                      "c": [
                        "Cryptographic shreds across cold back-ups"
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "7. Your Rights under the DPDP Act, 2023",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "t": "p",
          "c": [
            "As a Data Principal under India’s Digital Personal Data Protection Act, 2023, you hold legally enforceable rights over your digital persona:"
          ]
        },
        {
          "t": "p",
          "c": [
            {
              "t": "strong",
              "c": [
                "Right to Summary Access:"
              ]
            },
            " You can request a clear overview of all biographical, behavioral, and matching parameters held by us."
          ]
        },
        {
          "t": "p",
          "c": [
            {
              "t": "strong",
              "c": [
                "Right to Correction:"
              ]
            },
            " Update outdated commute choices, changing job locations, dietary shifts, or incorrect name representations."
          ]
        },
        {
          "t": "p",
          "c": [
            {
              "t": "strong",
              "c": [
                "Right to Erasure & Forgetting:"
              ]
            },
            " Request complete digital decommissioning of your biodata once you have secured tenancy."
          ]
        },
        {
          "t": "p",
          "c": [
            {
              "t": "strong",
              "c": [
                "Right to Consent Revocation:"
              ]
            },
            " Withdraw permission at any point through the settings dashboard without incurring service penalization."
          ]
        },
        {
          "t": "p",
          "c": [
            {
              "t": "strong",
              "c": [
                "Right to Data Portability:"
              ]
            },
            " Obtain a standard machine-readable JSON archive containing all personal records within 7 days of submitting a valid request."
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "8. Security & Encryption Standards",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "t": "p",
          "c": [
            "Flatrimony enforces defence-in-depth protocols across every network layer:"
          ]
        },
        {
          "t": "p",
          "c": [
            "In Transit"
          ]
        },
        {
          "t": "p",
          "c": [
            "Enforced TLS 1.3 protocol with HTTP Strict Transport Security (HSTS) across all client connections."
          ]
        },
        {
          "t": "p",
          "c": [
            "At Rest"
          ]
        },
        {
          "t": "p",
          "c": [
            "Hardware-accelerated AES-256 bit column-level database encryption for sensitive profile columns."
          ]
        },
        {
          "t": "p",
          "c": [
            "Internal Access"
          ]
        },
        {
          "t": "p",
          "c": [
            "Strict Role-Based Access Control (RBAC) requiring hardware security keys (FIDO2/WebAuthn) for staff."
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "9. Grievance Redressal & Data Protection Desk",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "t": "p",
          "c": [
            "In adherence to Section 10 of the Digital Personal Data Protection Act, 2023, Flatrimony has designated a senior legal professional to supervise compliance and resolve inquiries:"
          ]
        },
        {
          "t": "p",
          "c": [
            "Designated Officer:"
          ]
        },
        {
          "t": "p",
          "c": [
            "[Grievance Officer name]"
          ]
        },
        {
          "t": "p",
          "c": [
            "Official Title:"
          ]
        },
        {
          "t": "p",
          "c": [
            "Data Protection Officer & Grievance Officer"
          ]
        },
        {
          "t": "p",
          "c": [
            "Direct Redressal Email:"
          ]
        },
        {
          "t": "p",
          "c": [
            "[grievance email]"
          ]
        },
        {
          "t": "p",
          "c": [
            "Physical Desk:"
          ]
        },
        {
          "t": "p",
          "c": [
            "[Registered address]"
          ]
        },
        {
          "t": "p",
          "c": [
            "Statutory SLA:"
          ]
        },
        {
          "t": "p",
          "c": [
            "Acknowledgement within 24 hrs · Resolution within 15 days (For immediate civilian distress, dial 112)"
          ]
        },
        {
          "t": "h3",
          "c": [
            "Have data protection or privacy inquiries?"
          ]
        },
        {
          "t": "p",
          "c": [
            "If you have questions regarding our DPDP compliance, DigiLocker partner authentication, or wish to exercise your data erasure rights, contact our Data Protection Office directly at [privacy email]."
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
